/** \page epmFeatures Features
 *
 * - Full spectral expansion
 *    - Spherical harmonics for the angular variables
 *       - Fast fourier transform for the longitudinal component
 *       - Gauss-Legendre quadrature for the latitudinal component
 *    - Radial basis
 *       - Gauss-Chebyshev quadrature for worland polynomials.
 *
 * - Timestepping:
 *    - Predictor/Corrector scheme
 *    - Adaptive timestep
 *
 * - HDF5 I/O:
 *   - State files
 *   - Imposed fields / source fields
 *   - HDF5 Paraview visualisation format
 *   - Parallel reading/writing
 *
 * - XML parameters file
 *
 * - MPI parallelisation: 
 *
 * - Memory usage:
 *
 * - Boundary conditions:
 *    - Only homogeneous boundary conditions
 *
 * - Simple ASCII diagnostic files
*/
